" A session whose account hits a limit        "
" rotates to the account of the same          "
" provider with the most room left, on the    "
" same model, unless sessions are pinned. A   "
" fallback account is used only once every    "
" other one of its provider is at its limit   "
" or logged out. Pinning is set in the        "
" machine's daemon config ([failover] pin).   "
